chapter HOPAT

session HOPAT = HOL +
  description \<open>
    Towards formalizing higher-order pattern unification (Nipkow's algorithm)
    on de Bruijn lambda-terms, following Grobauer's pen-and-paper proofs.
    Also contains the substitution lemma in three styles (de Bruijn, Nominal,
    Nominal2) for comparison.
  \<close>
  options [quick_and_dirty]
  sessions
    "HOL-Library"
    "HOL-Nominal"
    "HOL-Proofs-Lambda"
    Nominal2
  theories
    Partial_Termination
    DeBruijn_Substitution_Lemma
    Nominal_Substitution_Lemma
    Nominal2_Substitution_Lemma
    Unif_Termination
  document_files
    "root.bib"
    "root.tex"
